  description: It's the Symbol of Peace himself, All Might! Colorful with a dramatic
    flair, the legendary hero and possessor of the One For All Quirk has stood as
    a protector of the people for years. He is very protective of those under his
    care, and can always be found smiling even in the face of danger. Plus Ultra!
